---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于" lang="zh" flush>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <span class="eyebrow">About SimuLearn</span>
      <h1>一名仿真工程师的<br />长期知识工程</h1>
      <p>SimuLearn 不是课程目录，也不是软件按钮说明书。它记录从问题定义到验证结论之间的判断依据。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container about-layout">
      <div class="identity">
        <span>AUTHOR</span>
        <h2>{siteConfig.author}</h2>
        <p>{siteConfig.role.zh}</p>
      </div>

      <article>
        <section>
          <span class="section-code">01 / WHY</span>
          <h2>为什么建立这个站</h2>
          <p>仿真经验最容易丢失的不是操作步骤，而是当时为什么选择这个模型、如何判断结果可信，以及失败后怎样定位根因。SimuLearn 用统一结构保存这些判断过程。</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <span class="section-code">02 / DIRECTION</span>
          <h2>从结构走向芯片多物理场</h2>
          <p>当前基础来自结构有限元、ANSYS、Abaqus 与工程数据分析。未来十年将依次补齐热、流体、多物理场耦合，重点进入芯片封装可靠性与电子散热，并逐步学习器件和工艺 TCAD。</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <span class="section-code">03 / STANDARD</span>
          <h2>内容标准</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>知识：</strong>说明适用边界，不只罗列结论。</li>
            <li><strong>案例：</strong>保留问题、假设、设置、验证与失败分支。</li>
            <li><strong>工具：</strong>给出输入、输出和不能替代的工程判断。</li>
            <li><strong>进度：</strong>区分已实践、学习中和路线规划。</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section>
          <span class="section-code">04 / CONTACT</span>
          <h2>代码与交流</h2>
          <p>网站源码公开托管于 GitHub。工程案例均经过脱敏，未公开内容不会通过本站外传。</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/xiaoluobo1234/simulearn-site" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">查看 GitHub 仓库 ↗</a>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 190px 1fr; gap: 4rem; }
  .identity { position: sticky; top: 100px; align-self: start; padding: 1.2rem; color: #a9c0c1; background: var(--color-primary-deep); border-top: 3px solid var(--color-accent); }
  .identity > span, .section-code { color: var(--color-accent); font: 600 .62rem/1 var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .identity h2 { color: white; border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 1.3rem 0 .5rem; font-size: 1.5rem; }
  .identity p { margin: 0; font-size: .75rem; }
  article section { padding-bottom: 3rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  article section:last-child { border: 0; margin-bottom: 0; }
  article h2 { border: 0; padding: 0; margin: .8rem 0 1.2rem; }
  article p, article li { color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
  article li { margin-bottom: .8rem; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .identity { position: static; }
  }
</style>
